# TDD

No implementation before an accepted specification and an observed Red test.
For each acceptance criterion: write the narrowest failing test, verify its
failure reason, implement the minimum Green change, then refactor and rerun.
Never weaken a criterion or test to obtain Green. A skipped or zero-test suite
is not evidence.
